#X text 513 86 This subpatch generates a euclidian rhythm based on a number of steps \, a number of hits and an offset. The algorithm works by distributing the hits evenly among the steps. The offset is optional \, but can be used for variation. The algortithm works best if the number of steps and the number of hits are relatively prime., f 67;
